    narr:generatedFrom "08dbf2d09d3a625ffd65c009778ee0a98c8715fd" ;
    narr:narration """Tanya's voice here spans a product thesis, a beta relationship, and a channel-strategy thread. The thesis runs from [renaming the product to installable expertise](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24) through [the technical moat of extracting citable perspective from documents](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_26) to [the target market of experts packaging work in static forms](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_28) and [the bottleneck framing of delegated expert work](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_30). She holds [a platform-over-toolbox ambition](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_32) as principle, while distribution stays exploratory: [seeding perspectives from people she knows](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_34) and [a podcast-driven marketplace](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_7). A second thread grounds the product in [her fiancé as beta tester, not sales target](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_44), [her prolific verbal feedback](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_54), and [the admitted hard edge of users not knowing what to say](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_58). A newer thread reframes a channel: [the product is not a phone number but a distribution channel](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_8), with [the felt value of the phone-number medium](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_15), [its fraud and maintenance cost](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_21), [an enterprise-only SMS proposal](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_46), and [a deferred tier-mapping decision](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_47).""" ;
